<title>NORWAY: Statoil says China Lufeng oil ship running on time.</title>
<headline>Statoil says China Lufeng oil ship running on time.</headline>
<dateline>OSLO 1997-03-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Den norske stats oljeselskap AS (Statoil ) said on Thursday the multipurpose shuttle tanker Munin for the Chinese Lufeng oilfield had left dry dock in South Korea and looked likely to be delivered to schedule.</p>
<p>Installation of advanced production systems is due to take three months from July.</p>
<p>Munin will then be installed on Lufeng in The South China Sea and tied back to a seabed template. Oil production is due to begin before the end of 1997.</p>
<p>--Oslo newsroom, +47 22 42 50 41</p>
</text>
